  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Nullstelle rechnerisch bestimmen</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 12px;'>Um die Nullstelle <strong>rechnerisch</strong> zu finden, setzt du <strong>f(x) = 0</strong> und l&ouml;st die Gleichung nach x auf.</p><div style='background:#f8f8f8;border:1.5px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:12px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;'>Beispiel: f(x) = 2x &minus; 4</p><div style='font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:2.2;'><span style='color:#dc2626;'>f(x) = 0</span><br>2x &minus; 4 = 0<br>2x = 4 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;| + 4<br>x&nbsp;&nbsp; = 2 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;| &divide; 2<br><strong>x₀ = 2</strong></div></div><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;'><strong>Vorgehen:</strong><br>1. f(x) = 0 setzen<br>2. b auf die andere Seite bringen<br>3. Durch m dividieren<br>4. x₀ = &minus;b / m</div></div><div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgaben &ndash; Bestimme die Nullstelle</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>a)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>f(x) = 3x &minus; 6</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>x₀&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>b)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>g(x) = &minus;x + 4</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>x₀&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='4' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>c)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>h(x) = 2x + 6</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>x₀&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-3' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>d)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>k(x) = 4x + 8</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>x₀&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-2' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(15)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(15)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-15'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:2.2;'>a) 3x = 6 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x₀ = <strong>2</strong><br>b) x = 4 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x₀ = <strong>4</strong><br>c) 2x = &minus;6 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x₀ = <strong>&minus;3</strong><br>d) 4x = &minus;8 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x₀ = <strong>&minus;2</strong></p>"
}
